WEBVTT

01:47.040 --> 01:50.000
After the ennoblement,
monitor your master.

01:50.080 --> 01:52.560
Pass any information to Prince Jing.

01:52.640 --> 01:53.680
If you disobey,

01:54.360 --> 01:57.040
you'll end up like Dai, dead.

02:03.680 --> 02:04.880
Who are you?

02:04.960 --> 02:06.600
Monitor your master.

02:07.400 --> 02:10.160
Do you really think
your burn was an accident?

02:21.480 --> 02:24.880
All ten Xiyan Beauties,
besides their fake identities,

02:24.960 --> 02:26.800
they all have identical burns
on their wrists.

02:26.880 --> 02:28.200
General Yin,

02:28.280 --> 02:30.040
why don't we just arrest them all
and interrogate them together?

02:30.960 --> 02:32.560
This concerns the peace-making marriage.

02:32.640 --> 02:35.360
Causing too much commotion
would be difficult to handle.

02:37.320 --> 02:39.040
We'll have to investigate
each case individually.

02:39.880 --> 02:41.960
Ten Beauties with burns?

02:42.040 --> 02:43.320
All on their right wrists?

02:44.600 --> 02:45.880
Clearly, that was no accident.

02:54.440 --> 02:55.480
YI, SCARS OF ULCERATION ON THE RIGHT WRIST
FROM XIYAN PINGZHOU

02:55.560 --> 02:56.840
DONGXIA, SCARS OF ULCERATION
ON THE RIGHT WRIST, FROM XIYAN YONGZHOU

02:56.920 --> 02:58.240
HANYAN, SCARS OF ULCERATION
ON THE RIGHT WRIST, FROM XIYAN YONGZHOU

02:58.320 --> 03:00.160
But why isn't Mei Lin among them,

03:00.240 --> 03:01.680
even though her wrist is burned too?

03:01.760 --> 03:02.680
General Yin,

03:02.760 --> 03:06.400
I suspect all of this
may be related to Prince Jing.

03:07.320 --> 03:08.320
I've checked.

03:08.400 --> 03:10.400
When the ten Beauties were burned,

03:10.480 --> 03:12.560
Attendant Liu was present.
She used to work at Rong'an Palace.

03:13.560 --> 03:15.720
She's certainly following orders
from Prince Jing.

03:16.400 --> 03:17.800
These Beauties are about to be ennobled

03:17.880 --> 03:19.560
and enter the households
of Great Yan's officials.

03:20.240 --> 03:21.280
If this is some kind of plot…

03:22.560 --> 03:23.400
Do not jump to conclusions.

03:24.920 --> 03:26.320
Forgive me, General Yin,
but I'm not making baseless claims.

03:27.080 --> 03:29.000
Ever since Mei Lin entered
the Court of State Ceremonial,

03:29.080 --> 03:30.400
Prince Jing has been
a frequent visitor there.

03:31.000 --> 03:32.800
He's even done a lot
of absurd things for her.

03:33.400 --> 03:34.960
In my view,

03:35.040 --> 03:37.240
Prince Jing is using his affection
for Mei Lin as an excuse

03:37.320 --> 03:38.240
to contact spies.

03:39.120 --> 03:41.040
If we bring Mei Lin in for interrogation,

03:41.120 --> 03:42.200
we might uncover something.

03:55.960 --> 03:59.080
My lord, Li Qing has indeed
been hidden in the West Mountain Mine.

03:59.160 --> 04:01.400
There have been occasional disturbances
by the miners.

04:01.480 --> 04:03.360
Li Qing is imprisoned
in the dungeon beneath the mine.

04:06.600 --> 04:09.400
The commander of the Lulin Army
at the mine, Yang Zhen,

04:09.480 --> 04:11.640
has secretly pledged loyalty
to the Crown Prince.

04:12.880 --> 04:15.400
Zhang Yin simply hid Li Qing
right under our noses.

04:15.480 --> 04:16.399
It's risky but daring.

04:16.480 --> 04:19.880
So, we'll have to snatch Li Qing
right under the Crown Prince's nose?

04:20.800 --> 04:22.320
If I disguise myself as a guard,

04:22.400 --> 04:23.880
it will surely
attract the Crown Prince's attention.

04:25.760 --> 04:29.120
It seems capturing Li Qing
will require a longer plan.

04:29.720 --> 04:30.880
Your Highness,

04:33.200 --> 04:34.400
a letter from
the Court of State Ceremonial reports

04:34.480 --> 04:36.880
that General Yin has discovered
Attendant Liu burned the Beauties,

04:36.960 --> 04:39.480
and Mei Lin has been secretly summoned
to the General's mansion.

04:40.280 --> 04:42.880
ZHIGE HALL

04:46.760 --> 04:48.680
What business
does General Yin have with me?

04:48.760 --> 04:52.960
Interrogating a Beauty doesn't require
General Yin's involvement.

04:54.680 --> 04:56.080
You're no ordinary Beauty.

04:58.920 --> 05:01.960
You're a spy from Xiyan.
According to Great Yan's law,

05:02.760 --> 05:04.960
spies are sentenced to death by burning.

05:05.640 --> 05:09.520
Accusing me of being a Xiyan spy,
do you have any proof?

05:14.920 --> 05:16.080
This is the proof.

05:18.760 --> 05:19.800
You're mistaken.

05:20.400 --> 05:23.200
I got this burn
from scalding myself while cooking.

05:28.080 --> 05:29.120
Tell me.

05:29.880 --> 05:30.960
Who is your master?

05:31.560 --> 05:32.520
Is it Prince Jing?

05:33.360 --> 05:36.560
Everyone knows I belong to Prince Jing.

05:38.440 --> 05:40.160
Do you think you're favored
for anything other than that face?

05:41.240 --> 05:42.640
It just so happens

05:43.400 --> 05:46.040
you look a little like our General.

05:52.920 --> 05:54.520
I don't think you have the right
to mete out punishment.

05:55.320 --> 05:57.160
Burning your face
doesn't require any rights anyway.

05:57.880 --> 05:58.840
Enough!

06:00.760 --> 06:01.840
General Yin.

06:02.480 --> 06:05.200
Abusing your power tarnishes my honor.

06:05.280 --> 06:07.440
This will be seen as insubordination.

06:08.200 --> 06:09.520
Go and receive your punishment.
Twenty strokes.

06:09.600 --> 06:11.960
Next time, I won't be so lenient.

06:12.040 --> 06:13.120
General Yin,

06:13.200 --> 06:14.800
- but she's connected to Prince Jing--
- Get out!

06:17.560 --> 06:18.720
Yes, General Yin.

06:29.400 --> 06:32.320
General Yin, I'm not a Xiyan spy.

06:32.400 --> 06:33.680
Please, trust me.

06:34.920 --> 06:36.280
How did you get this burn?

06:37.040 --> 06:38.400
I accidentally burned myself.

06:38.480 --> 06:40.000
- It was an accident.
- What accident?

06:44.400 --> 06:46.880
If the General has questions,
ask me instead.

06:46.960 --> 06:48.560
There's no need to trouble yourself

06:49.200 --> 06:51.600
by summoning my Beauty here.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.840
She has no secrets from me.

06:54.920 --> 06:57.040
After all, I even know

06:57.640 --> 06:59.600
every mole on her body.

07:09.680 --> 07:10.920
I received a secret report.

07:11.800 --> 07:13.800
Someone has been forcing
the Xiyan Beauties to act as spies,

07:13.880 --> 07:15.360
monitoring court officials.

07:15.440 --> 07:17.720
All of them
have matching scars on their wrists.

07:24.040 --> 07:25.280
Is she one of yours?

07:25.840 --> 07:28.800
- She's naturally mine.
- You know what I'm asking.

07:30.760 --> 07:32.080
Fine.

07:32.160 --> 07:35.400
- It was I who burned those Beauties.
- Why?

07:35.480 --> 07:36.880
Everyone
at the Court of State Ceremonial knows

07:36.960 --> 07:38.840
of the bond between Mei and me.

07:38.920 --> 07:42.120
Someone was jealous
and purposely burned Mei.

07:42.200 --> 07:46.520
I couldn't tolerate that,
so I retaliated in kind.

07:47.600 --> 07:49.240
Don't use her as an excuse.

07:50.320 --> 07:51.160
The Prince Jing I know

07:51.800 --> 07:53.120
wouldn't be involved
in something like this.

07:54.920 --> 07:57.040
I truly care for Mei.

07:57.120 --> 08:00.320
I can't bear for her
to suffer any injustice.

08:06.520 --> 08:08.760
You're not the type
to be caught up in such affairs.

08:08.840 --> 08:10.920
- Empress Dejia lectured you--
- Luomei.

08:11.000 --> 08:13.960
People change as they grow up.

08:27.320 --> 08:29.800
Just now, the General
mentioned something about spies.

08:31.520 --> 08:32.640
The Crown Prince couldn't deal with you,

08:33.240 --> 08:36.000
so he mimicked your burn mark to frame me,

08:36.080 --> 08:38.760
claiming I'm using the Xiyan Beauties
to bribe court officials

08:38.840 --> 08:40.039
and threaten the Crown Prince's position.

08:45.040 --> 08:46.440
Will those Beauties be in danger?

08:46.520 --> 08:49.360
If I win, they won't be harmed.

08:50.000 --> 08:51.280
So, you already have a plan?

08:52.080 --> 08:53.640
By taking down Zhang Yin,

08:53.720 --> 08:55.080
we can break through this dilemma.

09:00.560 --> 09:01.520
We must play this game perfectly

09:01.600 --> 09:04.000
or the Crown Prince will catch on.

09:04.080 --> 09:06.440
And no matter what happens,

09:07.040 --> 09:08.360
the most important thing
is to keep Mei Lin safe.

09:08.440 --> 09:11.080
Rest assured, my lord.
Mei Lin is skilled in martial arts.

09:11.160 --> 09:12.840
This will be a simple task for her.

09:15.760 --> 09:19.000
We're just one witness away
from breaking the stalemate.

09:20.120 --> 09:21.680
A witness that my father trusts.

09:23.520 --> 09:25.480
My lord, General Yin has come to visit.

09:25.560 --> 09:27.040
She's waiting in the courtyard.

09:29.240 --> 09:31.480
The witness has come.

09:47.480 --> 09:50.920
Since you left the capital,
I haven't visited this courtyard.

09:51.520 --> 09:54.560
This plum tree, you planted it yourself.

09:58.360 --> 10:00.440
It was you who forced me to plant it.

10:01.040 --> 10:03.400
I lost to you
in an archery contest that year,

10:03.480 --> 10:05.520
and you wouldn't let it go.

10:05.600 --> 10:08.880
You made me plant this tree as punishment.

10:12.080 --> 10:13.120
Jinghe,

10:14.240 --> 10:15.880
did you ever consider
that perhaps the archery contest

10:17.000 --> 10:18.680
was just an excuse?

10:21.000 --> 10:23.680
I don't believe you burned the Beauties
to win Mei Lin's favor.

10:24.760 --> 10:26.120
What are you really up to?

10:29.000 --> 10:30.640
Well,

10:30.720 --> 10:33.960
what I want is that supreme position.

10:39.960 --> 10:41.480
That position belongs
to whoever is worthy.

10:42.480 --> 10:43.960
If you've got the glory,

10:44.040 --> 10:45.880
you can simply go for it
openly and honestly.

10:46.480 --> 10:49.360
Why resort to using Xiyan spies
and underhanded methods?

10:54.000 --> 10:55.320
General Yin,

10:56.000 --> 10:58.080
you're overthinking it.

10:58.160 --> 11:00.040
No matter which path I take,

11:00.120 --> 11:03.440
I would never do anything
to harm my country.

11:03.520 --> 11:06.080
Then, what about these Xiyan spies?

11:10.000 --> 11:11.400
General Yin, do you remember

11:11.480 --> 11:13.640
the Zhonglin Mountain
where we used to hunt?

11:13.720 --> 11:17.120
Come meet me there in three days,
and you'll have your answer.

11:21.400 --> 11:24.320
PRINCE JING'S MANSION

11:28.920 --> 11:29.760
This was my failure.

11:29.840 --> 11:31.880
Once I capture Zhang Yin,
I'll accept my punishment.

11:32.480 --> 11:34.320
Send everyone.
Make sure he's captured alive.

11:34.400 --> 11:35.680
Yes, my lord.

11:41.400 --> 11:42.960
What? He's still alive?

11:43.560 --> 11:45.080
He escaped from Prince Jing's mansion

11:45.160 --> 11:46.280
and fled to the outskirts.

11:47.280 --> 11:49.400
Zhang Yin. He's even more cunning
than I thought.

11:49.480 --> 11:51.480
He escaped from Prince Jing's grasp.

11:52.240 --> 11:53.440
Take everyone.

11:53.520 --> 11:55.680
This time,
I'll see him die with my own eyes.

11:55.760 --> 11:56.600
Yes, Your Highness.

12:35.760 --> 12:38.120
Attract them to Zhonglin Slope.
Zhang Yin is there.

13:12.680 --> 13:15.080
The death-point hold
will only last for two hours.

13:15.160 --> 13:17.640
The rest is up to you, my lord.

13:36.520 --> 13:37.800
Your Highness, he's dead.

13:38.480 --> 13:40.360
- Hurry, take the body away.
- Yes, Your Highness.

13:48.400 --> 13:49.960
Third Brother, once again,
you're too late.

13:51.560 --> 13:54.160
This time, I've won.

13:54.240 --> 13:57.600
However, no one wins forever.

13:59.400 --> 14:00.920
Murong Jinghe!

14:03.800 --> 14:05.320
Luo Mei?

14:06.040 --> 14:09.040
You used General Yin
to stage the Xiyan spy plot,

14:09.120 --> 14:12.320
so, of course, I could also use her
as my own witness.

14:13.080 --> 14:15.600
A witness
who can expose Zhang Yin's death.

14:16.360 --> 14:20.000
That arrow bears the mark
of the Eastern Palace.

14:20.080 --> 14:22.160
Zhang Yin was just a low-ranking official.

14:22.240 --> 14:24.560
Even if you dragged his corpse to Father,

14:24.640 --> 14:26.760
he wouldn't take your word for it.

14:27.600 --> 14:30.240
A mere body won't shake your position.

14:31.080 --> 14:35.200
But it can plant a seed of doubt
in our father's heart.

14:37.280 --> 14:40.480
The Wenhua Pavilion fire
was overseen by you alone.

14:41.320 --> 14:44.520
If Father finds out
you silenced someone to cover it up…

14:46.280 --> 14:48.080
After all your years
of careful maneuvering,

14:48.160 --> 14:52.160
why ruin your image
in front of Father now?

14:52.240 --> 14:55.040
So, what do you want?

14:55.720 --> 14:58.080
You know me well.

14:58.160 --> 15:02.000
As long as you help me
solve the Xiyan spy situation,

15:02.080 --> 15:04.880
I'll forget I ever saw Zhang Yin today.

15:05.680 --> 15:09.120
We both win a round, how about that?

15:12.280 --> 15:13.760
You won't lose anything.

15:15.720 --> 15:19.080
Even now,
I've never wanted to see you dead.

15:19.160 --> 15:20.560
Indeed.

15:20.640 --> 15:22.680
You just wanted
to send me back to Jingbei.

15:24.000 --> 15:26.440
But the contest between me and you
is far from over.

15:27.280 --> 15:28.840
How could I leave the battlefield now?

15:30.560 --> 15:31.840
Murong Jinghe!

15:32.800 --> 15:34.360
Murong Jinghe!

15:34.440 --> 15:36.960
General Yin. I'm here.

15:41.440 --> 15:45.920
Luomei suspects you
means Father suspects you.

15:47.240 --> 15:48.760
Doesn't that bother you?

15:53.960 --> 15:55.320
Thank you for your cooperation.

15:56.600 --> 15:58.240
Take the prey to Prince Jing's mansion.

16:06.320 --> 16:07.800
Ask our people to hide immediately.

16:10.920 --> 16:12.200
Yes, Your Highness.

16:26.520 --> 16:27.760
Why is the Crown Prince here?

16:28.320 --> 16:29.680
I invited Big Brother.

16:30.640 --> 16:33.120
I was nearly ambushed,
and I'm in low spirits.

16:33.840 --> 16:36.040
Only Big Brother
can help relieve my frustrations.

16:39.040 --> 16:41.720
It's only natural for an older brother

16:41.800 --> 16:43.320
to help his younger brother
in difficult times.

16:52.360 --> 16:54.200
How long has it been
since we last came to the archery range?

16:55.360 --> 16:56.200
Big Brother,

16:56.920 --> 16:59.600
you know I'm not in the mood
for reminiscing right now.

17:01.640 --> 17:02.720
Your Highness,

17:03.480 --> 17:06.119
what's the deal with the Xiyan spies case?

17:12.040 --> 17:13.040
It was Gan Ning,
the Vice Minister of Defense,

17:13.119 --> 17:14.800
who set a trap to frame Third Brother.

17:14.880 --> 17:16.280
He misunderstood our brotherly bond,

17:16.359 --> 17:18.040
thinking Prince Jing returned
to the capital to compete for the throne,

17:18.839 --> 17:21.079
so he wanted to send him back to Jingbei.

17:21.920 --> 17:23.079
Even though Gan Ning acted on his own,

17:23.160 --> 17:25.680
you were wronged because of me.

17:25.760 --> 17:28.119
I owe you an apology. Sorry.

17:30.800 --> 17:34.320
It's true that only Big Brother
can resolve my grievances.

17:48.640 --> 17:51.720
How about we have a match, like old times?

18:02.080 --> 18:05.360
Luomei, we all know I've always lost

18:06.360 --> 18:07.400
here on the arrow field.

18:07.480 --> 18:08.920
You have won before.

18:10.200 --> 18:11.760
The only time…

18:13.840 --> 18:15.080
was because of you.

18:18.560 --> 18:21.080
If you want to win, win fairly.

18:34.440 --> 18:35.680
I surrender.

18:36.720 --> 18:39.280
If Big Brother hadn't let me win,
I wouldn't have won at all.

18:40.120 --> 18:42.400
What's the point
in playing a game I can't win?

18:42.920 --> 18:43.880
It's meaningless.

18:45.880 --> 18:47.200
My grievances are resolved.

18:48.000 --> 18:52.080
I won't interrupt the reunion
between you two any longer.

19:01.920 --> 19:05.880
You're the only thing
I refuse to lose, Luomei.

19:28.040 --> 19:30.240
- The Third Prince has won again.
- The Third Prince wins again.

19:36.440 --> 19:38.720
Useless servants. What kind of bow
did you give Prince Xuanlie?

19:39.480 --> 19:40.480
I picked it myself.

19:40.560 --> 19:43.520
They slack off because you're too kind.

19:44.840 --> 19:45.720
Use mine.

19:48.960 --> 19:50.640
Xuanlie is much better than you.

19:50.720 --> 19:52.400
With a better bow,
I'm sure he can beat you.

19:52.480 --> 19:53.600
Let's try again.

19:53.680 --> 19:54.920
Okay. Let's have another match.

20:16.160 --> 20:17.240
Luomei, I've won.

20:17.960 --> 20:20.080
See? Like I said,
you couldn't beat Xuanlie.

20:22.160 --> 20:23.600
Third Brother is the best.

20:23.680 --> 20:25.000
This time, I just had good luck.

20:25.800 --> 20:27.120
But your archery is still better.

20:28.280 --> 20:30.880
One day, I'll surpass you, Big Brother.

20:33.200 --> 20:34.400
Luomei,

20:34.480 --> 20:36.720
you helped Big Brother win against me,
and I'm not even mad.

20:36.800 --> 20:38.040
What's making you upset?

20:41.000 --> 20:42.400
Father said

20:43.040 --> 20:45.320
the military camp is for men.

20:46.280 --> 20:47.880
He said I'm not allowed
to come here anymore.

20:49.160 --> 20:51.040
Why must women grow old
in the inner chambers

20:51.120 --> 20:52.480
once they marry?

20:54.320 --> 20:55.200
I refuse to marry!

20:56.360 --> 20:58.280
Luomei, don't worry.

20:59.040 --> 21:00.120
When I become a great general,

21:00.880 --> 21:03.160
I'll take you to the battlefield,
and we'll defend the country together.

21:04.720 --> 21:07.320
Besides, a female soldier stronger
than the men,

21:07.400 --> 21:08.960
why would I refuse that?

21:09.560 --> 21:12.600
- Really? It's a promise, then.
- It's a deal.

21:13.600 --> 21:15.880
Protect the nation! For Great Yan!

21:16.480 --> 21:17.320
For Great Yan!

21:17.400 --> 21:18.600
Protect the nation!

21:18.680 --> 21:20.120
- For Great Yan!
- For Great Yan!

21:20.200 --> 21:21.240
Protect the nation!

21:21.320 --> 21:22.920
- For Great Yan!
- For Great Yan!

21:29.000 --> 21:31.320
If it weren't for the bow
you gave me back then,

21:31.400 --> 21:32.440
how could I have won?

21:33.840 --> 21:35.760
Your Highness is a skilled archer.

21:36.520 --> 21:38.320
The result was all in your hands.

21:39.040 --> 21:40.280
I couldn't do much about it.

21:43.040 --> 21:46.720
If I want to live a peaceful life
in the imperial harem,

21:46.800 --> 21:48.320
I must keep losing.

21:59.320 --> 22:01.080
Everyone thinks I'm lucky,

22:02.080 --> 22:05.720
that even though my mother was lowborn
and died giving birth to me,

22:06.280 --> 22:09.960
I was fortunate
to be raised by Empress Dejia.

22:12.840 --> 22:14.280
Mother was kind to me.

22:15.080 --> 22:16.360
But the kinder she was,

22:17.280 --> 22:18.320
the more I suffered.

22:19.680 --> 22:21.360
The servants at Rong'an Palace,

22:21.440 --> 22:23.960
they've always feared that I,
the oldest son of His Majesty,

22:24.040 --> 22:25.720
would outshine
their precious little master.

22:27.960 --> 22:29.360
They've been against me from the start.

22:33.400 --> 22:36.080
I knew from the beginning
that bow was faulty.

22:37.120 --> 22:40.080
But because of you,
I had my first fair victory.

22:42.960 --> 22:44.080
Since that day,

22:44.160 --> 22:48.520
I've longed to stand before you

22:48.600 --> 22:51.080
and tell you my heart.

22:55.880 --> 22:56.720
Your Highness,

22:57.640 --> 23:00.600
the Pingnan Army
doesn't just guard the throne.

23:00.680 --> 23:02.920
It protects Great Yan's borders
and its people.

23:04.000 --> 23:05.760
I earned my military achievements

23:05.840 --> 23:07.400
to become a loyal subject of Great Yan.

23:08.800 --> 23:12.160
I won't be used as a pawn
in your fight for the throne.

23:13.920 --> 23:16.640
I don't want the Pingnan Army's power.

23:17.280 --> 23:20.000
I want you, Luomei. Do you understand?

23:22.000 --> 23:23.600
I've never forgotten your ambition.

23:23.680 --> 23:25.160
The promise Third Brother made to you,

23:26.200 --> 23:27.160
I'll fulfill it for you.

23:31.320 --> 23:33.000
WINTER'S HEIR, OF NOBLE ORIGIN
OUR BOND TRUE

23:33.080 --> 23:34.720
YOU ARE GRANTED THE SEAL OF FIRST CONSORT
ETERNAL GLORY AWAITS

23:37.520 --> 23:38.560
I have always said,

23:39.360 --> 23:40.880
even if you become Empress,

23:40.960 --> 23:41.840
the military power will remain yours.

23:42.680 --> 23:43.800
You'll still be General Yin,

23:44.680 --> 23:46.200
and I'll never confine you
to the imperial harem.

23:46.800 --> 23:49.080
If I break this promise, this vow,

23:49.160 --> 23:51.560
General Yin, you can make it public.

24:00.280 --> 24:03.320
I cannot bear your feelings.

24:41.360 --> 24:44.320
The Lord ordered you to wait here.

24:59.720 --> 25:01.120
You won?

25:02.520 --> 25:03.560
We have won.

25:07.560 --> 25:08.600
And the Beauties?

25:09.440 --> 25:10.520
Do not worry.

25:10.600 --> 25:13.120
I will find a way
to send them back to Xiyan safely.

25:19.920 --> 25:20.920
Are you hurt?

25:21.800 --> 25:22.960
Why didn't you wear the Gold Silk Armor?

25:29.560 --> 25:32.480
I did it on purpose. Otherwise,
I couldn't fool the Crown Prince.

25:34.160 --> 25:36.520
It's just a small injury.
It doesn't matter.

25:53.480 --> 25:54.440
Here's some wound medicine.

25:55.920 --> 25:57.160
It might…

26:00.720 --> 26:01.640
sting a bit.

26:04.040 --> 26:06.680
My lord, I'm not afraid of pain.

26:32.080 --> 26:32.960
Does it hurt?

26:35.440 --> 26:36.320
It's nothing.

26:37.640 --> 26:40.240
Just a minor injury. It won't kill me.

26:43.600 --> 26:45.400
You're not afraid of death, nor pain.

26:45.480 --> 26:48.200
Is there anything that you fear?

26:50.760 --> 26:51.920
Yeah.

26:53.520 --> 26:54.360
I'm afraid of my mother.

26:57.520 --> 27:00.600
One only truly values life
when they have someone to care for.

27:06.960 --> 27:08.040
Remember what you once said?

27:08.640 --> 27:11.000
Your hairpin is also a bridge
between the living and the dead.

27:11.880 --> 27:14.320
I believe your mother is watching
from above.

27:14.400 --> 27:15.400
Seeing you fight so hard,

27:16.240 --> 27:17.880
she must be worried too.

28:05.560 --> 28:06.400
Who's there?

28:07.760 --> 28:08.600
Who?

28:12.320 --> 28:13.360
Show yourself!

28:13.960 --> 28:15.560
Who's there? Come out!

28:15.640 --> 28:16.800
Who?

28:21.120 --> 28:22.240
Minister Zhang.

28:25.880 --> 28:28.440
PANG QI

28:29.720 --> 28:30.800
And you are?

28:31.560 --> 28:33.360
Minister Zhang, don't you remember me?

28:36.200 --> 28:37.400
Weibei Army.

28:38.760 --> 28:40.240
Vanguard Battalion.

28:42.000 --> 28:43.600
Pang Qi.

28:45.520 --> 28:47.280
You're supposed to be dead!

28:49.240 --> 28:50.160
So are you.

28:52.920 --> 28:54.040
Confess.

28:54.840 --> 28:56.360
Confess to every soldier
of the Weibei Army.

28:57.760 --> 28:59.000
Confess!

29:00.280 --> 29:01.680
Commander Pang, I'll confess.

29:01.760 --> 29:03.360
- I'll confess.
- Confess to them!

29:03.440 --> 29:05.200
Yes.

29:08.360 --> 29:11.280
Weibei Army Sheriff Liu Cheng. I confess.

29:12.320 --> 29:15.840
Weibei Army Deputy General Yang Donghu.

29:15.920 --> 29:17.120
I confess.

29:17.200 --> 29:20.360
Weibei Army Company Leader Wang Futian.
I confess.

29:31.560 --> 29:33.240
There is no more Weibei Army in this world

29:35.160 --> 29:36.360
and yet you stubbornly follow me,

29:37.440 --> 29:39.040
willing to live in a place like this.

29:40.800 --> 29:42.440
I swear I'll take you.

29:43.480 --> 29:46.360
I'll take them out of here.

29:46.960 --> 29:48.160
We'll live in the sunlight again.

30:21.160 --> 30:24.720
This sachet should help him
sleep better, right?

30:44.280 --> 30:45.440
My lord?

30:48.240 --> 30:49.440
Why haven't you left yet?

30:51.000 --> 30:53.080
- Have you been drinking?
- Don't touch me.

30:54.800 --> 30:56.080
In your hallucination,

30:57.080 --> 30:59.800
this is exactly how you treated me.

31:02.240 --> 31:03.480
So fierce.

31:05.240 --> 31:06.520
Why did you drink so much?

31:08.280 --> 31:11.400
I had to be fierce,
otherwise, I'd get bullied.

31:18.880 --> 31:23.000
You, so fierce,
yet still afraid of your mother?

31:24.200 --> 31:26.320
My mother always wanted me to get married.

31:27.320 --> 31:28.560
She was eager to send me off.

31:30.960 --> 31:32.520
And you don't want to get married?

31:34.360 --> 31:36.160
It's mostly because it's hard
to find a good live-in son-in-law.

31:37.080 --> 31:39.440
Why must you find a live-in son-in-law?

31:40.200 --> 31:43.520
My father is always away quarrying stone,

31:44.120 --> 31:46.240
so I'm the only one
who can take care of my mother.

31:47.800 --> 31:49.600
I planned
to take care of her my whole life.

31:53.760 --> 31:57.240
So, fear… comes from love.

32:01.080 --> 32:02.320
Are you afraid of me, then?

32:12.160 --> 32:13.480
You are a good person.

32:13.560 --> 32:14.800
I have no reason to fear you.

32:15.560 --> 32:16.840
I'm not a good person.

32:17.720 --> 32:19.920
I remember

32:20.000 --> 32:24.640
every single thing you've done to me.

32:26.000 --> 32:27.080
I…

32:27.680 --> 32:29.320
I even remember

32:30.160 --> 32:34.400
that the second time you saw me,

32:34.480 --> 32:37.960
you bit my lip.

32:45.920 --> 32:46.760
Well then,

32:48.000 --> 32:49.360
if you hold a grudge,

32:50.000 --> 32:51.120
you can bite me back.

33:17.880 --> 33:18.920
- Now,
- You…

33:19.520 --> 33:20.560
we can call it even.

33:26.760 --> 33:29.200
I'll be holding onto your hairpin for now.

33:29.920 --> 33:32.040
Once we've taken down the Crown Prince,

33:32.960 --> 33:34.160
I'll give it back to you.

33:34.720 --> 33:36.200
If you want to talk to your mother,

33:36.280 --> 33:38.400
come to me.

34:10.280 --> 34:12.520
Gan Ning, a mere vice minister,

34:13.719 --> 34:16.280
had the audacity to set up a trap
to frame a prince.

34:17.040 --> 34:19.840
Crown Prince, do you realize your guilt?

34:21.199 --> 34:23.400
Father, I failed to properly manage
my subordinates.

34:24.000 --> 34:25.520
I accept any punishment you deem fit.

34:26.239 --> 34:27.679
Your Majesty, please calm your anger.

34:27.760 --> 34:29.679
If not for the Crown Prince,

34:29.760 --> 34:32.159
this matter wouldn't have been
resolved so swiftly.

34:34.600 --> 34:35.600
General Yin, you may rise.

34:36.520 --> 34:37.600
Thank you, Your Majesty.

34:40.239 --> 34:42.840
The Xiyan spy matter

34:42.920 --> 34:44.719
didn't cause a scandal, all thanks to you.

34:44.800 --> 34:46.760
You've returned to the capital

34:47.679 --> 34:49.800
and should have been given some rest.

34:49.880 --> 34:53.560
Who knew all these troubles
would arise to keep you busy?

34:54.920 --> 34:57.600
It is my duty
to share Your Majesty's burdens.

34:58.440 --> 35:01.320
Good. Conclude this matter swiftly.

35:02.360 --> 35:04.400
Gan Ning will be executed in secret.

35:05.080 --> 35:08.520
As for the Beauties,
make sure they are comforted.

35:08.600 --> 35:10.640
But keep it quiet.

35:10.720 --> 35:12.160
Avoid stirring up tensions
between the two nations.

35:14.200 --> 35:15.040
Your Majesty,

35:15.880 --> 35:17.120
I believe

35:17.200 --> 35:18.920
that after being falsely accused,
these Xiyan Beauties

35:19.000 --> 35:20.800
will undoubtedly harbor resentment.

35:20.880 --> 35:22.040
It would be inappropriate for them
to continue the peace-making marriage.

35:23.440 --> 35:26.480
Why not send them back
to Xiyan with Mr. Yue Qin?

35:27.640 --> 35:29.240
This would show Your Majesty's magnanimity

35:29.960 --> 35:31.360
and quell the rumors.

35:33.480 --> 35:34.320
Okay.

35:35.080 --> 35:37.840
Then proceed according
to General Yin's suggestion.

35:38.440 --> 35:40.000
Yes, Your Majesty.

35:44.960 --> 35:46.360
I'll take my leave.

35:57.720 --> 36:01.320
Gan Ning borrowed his courage from you!

36:01.400 --> 36:03.360
Servants like him only follow the wind.

36:03.440 --> 36:06.200
If you weren't harboring concerns
about Jinghe,

36:06.280 --> 36:08.360
would Gan Ning have dared
frame a prince to prove his loyalty?

36:08.440 --> 36:09.440
Huh?

36:09.520 --> 36:14.440
Father, I bear no ill will
toward Third Brother at all.

36:15.440 --> 36:18.680
If you believe I'm unfit for the role,

36:18.760 --> 36:20.920
I am willing to give
the title of Crown Prince to him.

36:37.120 --> 36:38.520
Enough.

36:38.600 --> 36:39.800
Crown Prince,

36:39.880 --> 36:43.800
you're responsible
for the future of Great Yan.

36:45.680 --> 36:48.960
My expectations for you
are naturally higher than for Jinghe.

36:49.960 --> 36:52.000
He's never been in good health,

36:52.080 --> 36:53.640
and though his actions are reckless,

36:53.720 --> 36:56.960
as his elder brother,
you must bear more responsibility.

37:02.480 --> 37:03.640
I understand, Father.

37:04.280 --> 37:05.640
I will heed your teachings.

37:08.360 --> 37:11.000
His Majesty has granted you the right
to choose your own husband.

37:11.080 --> 37:12.520
General Yin, that means

37:12.600 --> 37:15.200
he hopes you will follow your heart.

37:16.880 --> 37:19.080
I truly care for Mei.

37:19.160 --> 37:22.800
I can't bear for her
to suffer any injustice.

37:25.480 --> 37:27.800
Luomei, people change

37:28.400 --> 37:29.760
as they grow up.

37:39.080 --> 37:42.640
HEIR OF A NOBLE FAMILY. MARRIAGE
TO LADY YIN, VIRTUOUS AND WISE, BESTOWED

38:16.440 --> 38:17.280
My lord.

38:19.400 --> 38:22.720
My lord. The Xiyan spy matter
has been fully resolved.

38:22.800 --> 38:25.080
The Crown Prince
has gotten what he deserved.

38:25.160 --> 38:26.960
I heard he had been kowtowing
in the Yanming Palace for hours.

38:27.640 --> 38:28.960
Did Father forgive him?

38:34.600 --> 38:36.720
In the end,
Father still cares for Big Brother.

38:38.640 --> 38:40.920
But truly, His Majesty
still favors you, my lord.

38:41.720 --> 38:42.640
Today, in court,

38:42.720 --> 38:44.600
His Majesty even mentioned
General Yin's marriage.

38:45.880 --> 38:47.160
In fact, His Majesty would prefer
to see a marriage

38:47.760 --> 38:49.200
between you and the Yin family.

38:49.280 --> 38:51.960
This came straight from Eunuch Liu.

38:52.960 --> 38:53.880
Besides,

38:53.960 --> 38:55.760
His Majesty has decreed
that none of the Beauties

38:55.840 --> 38:57.800
can leave the Court of State Ceremonial
without permission.

38:57.880 --> 39:00.640
I believe His Majesty is giving you
a hint.

39:01.680 --> 39:03.520
Is Father trying to play matchmaker again?

39:05.440 --> 39:07.920
Tell Lianxiu. When Mei Lin is ennobled
and enters the mansion,

39:08.000 --> 39:09.640
she is to be received
with the ceremony of a concubine.

39:09.720 --> 39:10.840
Hopefully,

39:10.920 --> 39:12.720
that will put an end
to Father's thoughts of matchmaking.

39:13.320 --> 39:14.480
Yes, Your Highness.

39:22.440 --> 39:27.280
SHUANGLIN COURTYARD

39:28.800 --> 39:30.000
Shuanglin Courtyard…

39:30.080 --> 39:31.640
Isn't this courtyard a bit small?

39:33.080 --> 39:35.880
My lord, besides your Zhanyue Pavilion,
Shuanglin Courtyard is the largest.

39:35.960 --> 39:38.360
Moreover, it's the closest
to Zhanyue Pavilion,

39:38.440 --> 39:39.440
and it gets the best sunlight.

39:43.240 --> 39:46.080
Do you mean for Miss Mei Lin

39:46.160 --> 39:48.200
to move into Zhanyue Pavilion?

39:52.360 --> 39:53.240
No, Shuanglin Courtyard will do.

39:53.320 --> 39:55.760
Breaking the rules wouldn't be good.

39:57.560 --> 39:59.880
You are the least concerned
with rules, my lord.

40:13.520 --> 40:14.440
Leave it as is.

40:23.160 --> 40:24.200
The Imperial Agricultural Department

40:24.280 --> 40:26.600
recently cultivated
a few new green peony plants.

40:26.680 --> 40:28.240
His Majesty gifted one to us.

40:29.000 --> 40:30.720
My lord, if you enjoy flowers…

40:30.800 --> 40:32.800
I prefer these Undying Flowers.

40:38.600 --> 40:40.920
XIEYING PAVILION

40:41.000 --> 40:42.440
Buried in the soil, it finds its home.

40:43.040 --> 40:45.880
In times of famine, it fills bellies.
in times of prosperity, it adorns hair.

40:47.360 --> 40:49.680
Much better than any peony.

40:54.120 --> 40:56.360
It's been a long time
since I've seen you so happy.

41:25.520 --> 41:27.800
Now, we can call it even.

41:30.360 --> 41:32.680
I'll be holding onto your hairpin for now.

41:33.640 --> 41:35.960
Once we've taken down the Crown Prince,

41:36.040 --> 41:37.480
I'll give it back to you.

41:38.320 --> 41:39.600
If you want to talk to your mother,

41:39.680 --> 41:41.440
come to me.

41:44.880 --> 41:46.520
You are worried about me,

41:50.600 --> 41:51.600
right?

41:56.000 --> 41:58.480
Miss Mei Lin, time to drink your medicine.

41:58.560 --> 41:59.680
Attendant Liu.

42:06.480 --> 42:07.880
Candied fruit?

42:09.160 --> 42:10.320
Prince Jing said that soon,

42:10.400 --> 42:13.040
you'll be able to taste again.

42:15.040 --> 42:18.600
These candied fruits
were prepared especially for you

42:18.680 --> 42:20.480
to take the bitterness
out of the medicine.

42:21.520 --> 42:22.640
Thank you, Attendant Liu.

42:24.240 --> 42:26.600
In a few days, you'll be ennobled.

42:26.680 --> 42:28.200
When you enter Prince Jing's mansion,

42:28.280 --> 42:29.520
make sure to thank him properly.

42:29.600 --> 42:32.600
Once my taste returns,
I'll thank him immediately.

42:33.280 --> 42:35.480
- I'll take my leave now.
- Alright.
